[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 181.43, "timestamp": "00:03:01", "text": "或者，我能为路过的人做些什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 188.949, "timestamp": "00:03:08", "text": "因为有些人根本不会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 191.83, "timestamp": "00:03:11", "text": "我注意到了，我知道我不想那样。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 193.55, "timestamp": "00:03:13", "text": "希望他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 196.309, "timestamp": "00:03:16", "text": "即使我们拥有很多东西，也要注意到这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 198.47, "timestamp": "00:03:18", "text": "我们那边的直播间里正在发生什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 200.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:20", "text": "正确的？我们有子动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 205.71, "timestamp": "00:03:25", "text": "计时器和捐款目标，一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 208.949, "timestamp": "00:03:28", "text": "时间。我需要修理一下上面的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 226.63, "timestamp": "00:03:46", "text": "所以，我一直在思考这个问题。我准备好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 230.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:50", "text": "比如设计类似小部件的东西。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 232.99, "timestamp": "00:03:52", "text": "那是不是像个弹出窗口？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 235.63, "timestamp": "00:03:55", "text": "输入装置？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 238.869, "timestamp": "00:03:58", "text": "或者，我可以等我确定的时候再让它出现。"}]